{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world just like ours, but with a dark secret. Individuals gifted with extraordinary powers live among us, hiding in the shadows. A clandestine government agency hunts them down, claiming they pose a threat to humanity. But do they really?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a thrilling, emotional, and gritty narrative. Experience the conflict from both sides of the divide: the hunter and the hunted. Feel the burden of power and the responsibility that comes with it. Or, do whatever it takes to stop those who wield it. Is it all really that simple? Can your actions change the world around our protagonists? Do you have what it takes to shape their fate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as Jake</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194000/extras/4fbdc8457635f3ad7f7a4861de4b8637.avif?t=1768200450\" width=616 height=346 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fates, you experience the story through dual perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, there is Jake. A typical college student who simply wants a normal life. But a twist of fate reveals dormant powers that will change his existence forever. Now, he must navigate a dangerous new reality where &quot;normal&quot; is no longer an option.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as Amy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194000/extras/09bb29aa4de15d0426d059542fb552ed.avif?t=1768200450\" width=616 height=346 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there is Amy. Fresh out of the FBI Academy, she starts her new career with a secret government division known only as &quot;The Company.&quot; She is eager to serve, but she has no idea what is truly waiting for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump back and forth between these two characters to experience a complex, weaving narrative from opposing sides.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Mature Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194000/extras/45fac4ba721bc1981163b4ee5037bd1c.poster.avif?t=1768200450\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194000/extras/45fac4ba721bc1981163b4ee5037bd1c.webm?t=1768200450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194000/extras/45fac4ba721bc1981163b4ee5037bd1c.mp4?t=1768200450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fates: Determination offers not only a deep, extraordinary story but enhances it with optional high-quality adult scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer to focus on the plot? No problem. Every intimate scene can be bypassed through in-game choices. You have the freedom to enjoy the entire story without seeing a single sex scene if you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Choice Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194000/extras/44848c35a34e2e6663eebe1ea1978314.avif?t=1768200450\" width=616 height=346 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will face difficult decisions for both protagonists. These choices will determine the path Jake and Amy take. Will they walk a path of righteousness or ruin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your decisions, the story will branch significantly. Can you unlock all 4 distinct endings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3000 static images </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\